 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, July to August and August to September each came in at 48% of normal and November to December at 36%. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February sits at 38% and February to March at 36%. Grid 19968 had its driest year in 1963 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
